{
  "name": "Osaki 02 — Produccion",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Osaki — nuevo video",
        "formDescription": "Escribe el tema. El pipeline investiga, verifica fuentes y te trae tres angulos.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Tema del video",
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "form-inicio",
      "name": "Tema del video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -720,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "osaki-nuevo-video",
      "notes": "Arranca a mano y a proposito. Un canal que publica solo no es un canal: es una granja de contenido."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:4599/videos",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 1800000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ title: $json[\"Tema del video\"] }) }}"
      },
      "id": "crear",
      "name": "Crear video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -500,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "osaki-token",
          "name": "Osaki"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Crea el registro y devuelve su id, que arrastra el resto del flujo."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:4599/videos/{{ $('Crear video').item.json.video.id }}/stages/research",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 1800000
        }
      },
      "id": "research",
      "name": "Investigar y verificar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -280,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "osaki-token",
          "name": "Osaki"
        }
      },
      "notes": "El nucleo. Si no reune el minimo de afirmaciones verificadas, esta llamada falla y el flujo se para aqui. Es lo correcto: el tema no daba."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:4599/videos/{{ $('Crear video').item.json.video.id }}/stages/angles",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 1800000
        }
      },
      "id": "angles",
      "name": "Proponer 3 angulos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        -60,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "osaki-token",
          "name": "Osaki"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:4599/videos/{{ $('Crear video').item.json.video.id }}/angles",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 1800000
        }
      },
      "id": "leer-angulos",
      "name": "Leer angulos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        160,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "osaki-token",
          "name": "Osaki"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Se leen para pintarlos en el formulario de aprobacion."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resume": "form",
        "formTitle": "APROBACION #1 — elige el angulo",
        "formDescription": "={{ $json.angles.map(a => `[${a.id}] ${a.title}\\n   Gancho: ${a.hook}\\n   Tesis: ${a.thesis}\\n   Por que funciona: ${a.whyThisWorks}\\n`).join('\\n') }}",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Angulo",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "a1"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "a2"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "a3"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Notas",
              "fieldType": "textarea"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "gate-1",
      "name": "GATE 1 — Aprobar angulo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        380,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "osaki-gate-angulo",
      "notes": "APROBACION HUMANA #1. La ejecucion queda SUSPENDIDA aqui hasta que envies el formulario. Nada del grafo posterior puede correr antes."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:4599/videos/{{ $('Crear video').item.json.video.id }}/choose",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 1800000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ angleId: $json[\"Angulo\"], notes: $json[\"Notas\"] }) }}"
      },
      "id": "choose",
      "name": "Registrar eleccion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        600,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "osaki-token",
          "name": "Osaki"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Tu eleccion queda registrada junto a las alternativas que habia. Es la evidencia de aporte creativo humano."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:4599/videos/{{ $('Crear video').item.json.video.id }}/stages/script",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 1800000
        }
      },
      "id": "script",
      "name": "Escribir guion",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        820,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "osaki-token",
          "name": "Osaki"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:4599/videos/{{ $('Crear video').item.json.video.id }}/stages/storyboard",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 1800000
        }
      },
      "id": "storyboard",
      "name": "Storyboard",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1040,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "osaki-token",
          "name": "Osaki"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:4599/videos/{{ $('Crear video').item.json.video.id }}/stages/audio",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 1800000
        }
      },
      "id": "audio",
      "name": "Audio y timing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1260,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "osaki-token",
          "name": "Osaki"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Devuelve 409 si faltan grabaciones: no es un fallo, es el pipeline esperandote."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:4599/videos/{{ $('Crear video').item.json.video.id }}/stages/render",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 1800000
        }
      },
      "id": "render",
      "name": "Render",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1480,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "osaki-token",
          "name": "Osaki"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Puede tardar bastante: un video de diez minutos son miles de frames."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resume": "form",
        "formTitle": "APROBACION #2 — revisa el render",
        "formDescription": "=Revisa el video antes de que exista ninguna subida:\n\nhttp://localhost:4599/videos/{{ $('Crear video').item.json.video.id }}/render?token=PON_AQUI_TU_TOKEN\n\nSolo si lo apruebas se habilita la publicacion.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Decision",
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "approved"
                  },
                  {
                    "option": "rejected"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Notas",
              "fieldType": "textarea"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "gate-2",
      "name": "GATE 2 — Aprobar render",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1700,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "osaki-gate-render",
      "notes": "APROBACION HUMANA #2. En este grafo NO existe ningun nodo de subida antes de este punto. La restriccion es topologica, no una condicion."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:4599/videos/{{ $('Crear video').item.json.video.id }}/approve",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 1800000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ gate: \"render\", decision: $json[\"Decision\"], notes: $json[\"Notas\"] }) }}"
      },
      "id": "approve",
      "name": "Registrar decision",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1920,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "osaki-token",
          "name": "Osaki"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://host.docker.internal:4599/videos/{{ $('Crear video').item.json.video.id }}/stages/packaging",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 1800000
        }
      },
      "id": "packaging",
      "name": "Empaquetar",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        2140,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "osaki-token",
          "name": "Osaki"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Titulos, descripcion con capitulos y fuentes, tags y miniaturas."
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Tema del video": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Crear video",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Crear video": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Investigar y verificar",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Investigar y verificar": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Proponer 3 angulos",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Proponer 3 angulos": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Leer angulos",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Leer angulos": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "GATE 1 — Aprobar angulo",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "GATE 1 — Aprobar angulo": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Registrar eleccion",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Registrar eleccion": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Escribir guion",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Escribir guion": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Storyboard",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Storyboard": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Audio y timing",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Audio y timing": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Render",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Render": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "GATE 2 — Aprobar render",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "GATE 2 — Aprobar render": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Registrar decision",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Registrar decision": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Empaquetar",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "osaki"
    }
  ]
}
